# The split's retroactive sweep no longer replays the source's prepared
# mutations onto the destination. ShadowForwardOrphan(t,k) abstracts that
# replay (and the hot-path forward); without it the destination never sees
# the prepare at all.
MODULE: AtomicCommit
ROW: ShadowForwardOrphan(t,k)
